{"id": "141786", "name": "חישוב מכפלה פנימית מבסיס אורתונורמלי", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0.1, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "(", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "functions": [{"name": "randvervect", "params": ["n", "k"], "body": "transpose(makelist(rand_with_step(-k,k,1),n))"}, {"name": "vectToPoly", "params": ["vect"], "body": "block([poly:0], for i:0 thru (length(vect)-1) do(poly: poly + x^i*vect[i+1,1]),poly)"}, {"name": "polyToVect", "params": ["poly"], "body": "transpose(rest(coeff_list(x^n+poly,x),-1))"}, {"name": "matrify", "params": ["veclst"], "body": "block([mat:matrix([])], for i:1 thru length(veclst) do(mat:addcol(mat,veclst[i])),mat)"}, {"name": "dependentvects", "params": ["veclst"], "body": "is(rank(matrify(veclst))<length(veclst))"}], "questiontext": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px\"><div style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#4b1f6f;margin-bottom:6px\">הנתונים</div><p>נתונה מכפלה פנימית <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\langle\\cdot ,\\cdot \\rangle\\)</span> על המרחב <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\mathbb{R}_{\\leq 2}[x]\\)</span> כך שהפולינומים</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[p_1(x)={{CT:0}},\\]</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[p_2(x)={{CT:1}},\\]</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[p_3(x)={{CT:2}}\\]</p><p>מהווים בסיס אורתונורמלי.</p><p>עבור הפולינומים הנתונים</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[f_1(x)={{CT:3}},\\]</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[f_2(x)={{CT:4}},\\]</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[f_3(x)={{CT:5}}\\]</p></div><p>חשבו ביחס למכפלה פנימית זו:</p><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><div style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#4b1f6f;margin-bottom:8px\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:26px;height:26px;line-height:26px;text-align:center;border-radius:50%;background:#4b1f6f;color:#fff;margin-left:8px\">א׳</span></div><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">\\(\\langle f_1,f_2 \\rangle=\\) [[input:ans1]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans1]]</div></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><div style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#4b1f6f;margin-bottom:8px\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:26px;height:26px;line-height:26px;text-align:center;border-radius:50%;background:#4b1f6f;color:#fff;margin-left:8px\">ב׳</span></div><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">\\(\\lVert f_3 \\rVert=\\) [[input:ans2]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans2]]</div></div><p style=\"font-size:0.92em;margin:8px 0 0\"><b>תזכורת: </b>שימו לב שפתרונות מקורבים <b>לא יתקבלו</b> בשאלה זו. על מנת להזין שורש של מספר, יש לכתוב <code dir=\"ltr\">sqrt(X)</code> (כשבמקום X יש לכתוב את המספר).</p></div>", "generalfeedback": "", "specificfeedback": "[[feedback:prt1]][[feedback:prt2]]", "prtcorrect": "", "prtpartiallycorrect": "", "prtincorrect": "", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 10, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans2", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 10, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "prt1", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "